1
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:09,167
[DOOR OPENS]

2
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:11,600
[DOOR CLOSES]

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:18,433
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

4
00:00:25,133 --> 00:00:26,167
Chairman Song.

5
00:00:27,467 --> 00:00:30,267
Presenting, your daughter...

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:31,967
Hannah.

7
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:38,667
Hannah?

8
00:00:41,767 --> 00:00:45,200
I'm-- I'm not here
to ask for your acceptance.

9
00:00:47,067 --> 00:00:51,167
I just want to say
that the people here,

10
00:00:51,167 --> 00:00:52,300
your staff...

11
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,533
Please rehire them.

12
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:59,333
Dynasty Hotel is okay.
Please don't close it.

13
00:01:00,667 --> 00:01:03,667
[DOOR OPENS, CLOSES]

14
00:01:04,433 --> 00:01:07,767
[MUSIC BECOMES TENSE]

15
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:09,200
(In Korean)
That despicable woman

16
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,533
is not even your daughter!

17
00:01:11,167 --> 00:01:12,233
What?!

18
00:01:12,233 --> 00:01:18,433
[TENSE MUSIC SWELLS]

19
00:01:18,433 --> 00:01:21,233
That despicable woman
is not your daughter!

20
00:01:21,233 --> 00:01:22,600
What is she talking about?

21
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:25,667
She's a scammer, Dad!

22
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:29,300
(In Filipino) Wait, I don't
understand what you're saying.

23
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:30,467
That's not true.

24
00:01:31,533 --> 00:01:33,533
[SELENA] I met her, Min-jae.

25
00:01:33,533 --> 00:01:35,467
And I offered her money.

26
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:40,467
Do you really think
I want to be a Song?

27
00:01:41,267 --> 00:01:44,367
There! Shove that up your bangs!

28
00:01:44,367 --> 00:01:46,767
- [GASPS]
- [BRENDA] How dare you?!

29
00:01:46,767 --> 00:01:49,500
You're just a cheap gold digger!

30
00:01:50,267 --> 00:01:51,767
[DANIEL] I have proof, Chairman.

31
00:01:52,833 --> 00:01:54,667
Hannah is your daughter.

32
00:01:54,667 --> 00:02:01,667
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

33
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,700
<i> About the sample...</i>

34
00:02:21,633 --> 00:02:28,500
[TENSE MUSIC SWELLS]
